# ── Short, shareable stems ──
# IMPORTANT: a 200 rewrite keeps the pretty URL in the address bar, so the
# browser resolves relative asset paths against the STEM (/tree-of-life/…), not
# the repo root. Any page listed below must reference its assets root-absolute
# (/brand/…, /images-master/…) or they will 404 on the clean URL while working
# fine at the .html path. Both pages below were bitten by exactly this.
# Robert sends the application by text and email, so it must never be a .html
# link. Scoped under /tree-of-life rather than a bare /apply, so a future
# healing-group or training application can sit alongside it without a clash.
/tree-of-life/apply                              /tree-of-life-application.html   200
/apply                                           /tree-of-life/apply              301
/tree-of-life-application                        /tree-of-life/apply              301

